abstract: >-
  Artifact for the paper "Optimizing Bloom Filters on Modern GPUs." It
  contains the GPU SBF and CSBF implementations, WarpCore and GPU CBF
  baselines, correctness tests, a pinned container workflow, GUPS
  measurements, and result summarization scripts.
